e="color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.25)">–</span><span class="text-[13px] leading-snug" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.7)">Rate limits and concurrency set to your workload</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="shrink-0 text-[11px] mt-[3px]" style="color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.25)">–</span><span class="text-[13px] leading-snug" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.7)">ISO 27001</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="shrink-0 text-[11px] mt-[3px]" style="color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.25)">–</span><span class="text-[13px] leading-snug" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.7)">Enterprise SSO</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="shrink-0 text-[11px] mt-[3px]" style="color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.25)">–</span><span class="text-[13px] leading-snug" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.7)">Audit logs</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="shrink-0 text-[11px] mt-[3px]" style="color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.25)">–</span><span class="text-[13px] leading-snug" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.7)">VPC deployment</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="shrink-0 text-[11px] mt-[3px]" style="color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.25)">–</span><span class="text-[13px] leading-snug" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.7)">99.99% uptime SLA</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></section><div aria-hidden="true" class="w-full h-px" style="background-color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.08)"></div><section class="py-20 sm:py-28"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8"><div class="sm:text-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0s, transform 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0s"><span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] block leading-none" style="font-family:var(--font-geist-mono);font-weight:500;color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.4)">Agent and Browser</span><div class="mt-5"><h2 class="text-[32px] sm:text-[38px] lg:text-[44px] leading-[1.05]" style="font-family:var(--font-familjen);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.04em;color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.92)">Everything a run needs</h2></div></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.08s, transform 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.08s"><div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="min-w-0 px-6 sm:px-7 py-6 border" style="border-color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.09)"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-[19px] leading-[1.26]" style="font-family:var(--font-familjen);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.027em;color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.92)">LLM inference</span><span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.13em] px-1.5 py-1 leading-none" style="font-family:var(--font-geist-mono);font-weight:500;color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.55);border:1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 0.18)">Agent</span></div><p class="text-[14px] mt-[9px] leading-[1.57]" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.6)">The model the agent reasons with. No key to bring, no provider bill on top.</p></div><div class="min-w-0 px-6 sm:px-7 py-6 border" style="border-color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.09)"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-[19px] leading-[1.26]" style="font-family:var(--font-familjen);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.027em;color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.92)">Residential proxies</span></div><p class="text-[14px] mt-[9px] leading-[1.57]" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.6)">Requests route through real residential IPs, so sites serve the page they would serve a person.</p></div><div class="min-w-0 px-6 sm:px-7 py-6 border" style="border-color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.09)"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-[19px] leading-[1.26]" style="font-family:var(--font-familjen);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.027em;color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.92)">Anti-bot handling</span></div><p class="text-[14px] mt-[9px] leading-[1.57]" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.6)">Bot checks are handled at the infrastructure layer, before the run reaches them.</p></div><div class="min-w-0 px-6 sm:px-7 py-6 border" style="border-color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.09)"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-[19px] leading-[1.26]" style="font-family:var(--font-familjen);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.027em;color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.92)">Storage</span></div><p class="text-[14px] mt-[9px] leading-[1.57]" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.6)">Screenshots, logs and source URLs from every run, kept and addressable.</p></div></div></div></div></section><div aria-hidden="true" class="w-full h-px" style="background-color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.08)"></div><section class="py-16 sm:py-24"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8"><div class="text-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0s, transform 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0s"><h2 class="text-[32px] sm:text-[38px] lg:text-[44px] leading-[1.05]" style="font-family:var(--font-familjen);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.04em;color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.92)">Common questions</h2></div><div class="mt-12 max-w-[760px] mx-auto" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.08s, transform 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.08s"><div style="border-top:1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 0.08)"><div class="border-b last:border-b-0 transition-colors duration-150" style="border-color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.06)"><div class="relative"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 px-6 sm:px-8 py-5"><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><h3 class="m-0 transition-colors duration-150 text-base" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);font-weight:500;color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.9)">What is the Wallet?</h3></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-lg leading-none transition-colors duration-150" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);font-weight:300;color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.5)">+</span></div><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-_R_37hbsnrlb_" class="absolute inset-0 w-full cursor-pointer"><span class="sr-only">What is the Wallet?</span></button></div><div id="accordion-panel-_R_37hbsnrlb_" class="grid" style="grid-template-rows:0fr;visibility:hidden;transition:grid-template-rows 260ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1), visibility 0s 260ms"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-6 sm:px-8 pb-5"><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.6)">A prepaid balance on your account. Agent and Browser draw from it as they run; Search and Fetch never do. There is no subscription and no seats. You add funds and spend them on what you run.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="border-b last:border-b-0 transition-colors duration-150" style="border-color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.06)"><div class="relative"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 px-6 sm:px-8 py-5"><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><h3 class="m-0 transition-colors duration-150 text-base" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);font-weight:500;color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.9)">How do I add funds?</h3></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-lg leading-none transition-colors duration-150" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);font-weight:300;color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.5)">+</span></div><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-_R_57hbsnrlb_" class="absolute inset-0 w-full cursor-pointer"><span class="sr-only">How do I add funds?</span></button></div><div id="accordion-panel-_R_57hbsnrlb_" class="grid" style="grid-template-rows:0fr;visibility:hidden;transition:grid-template-rows 260ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1), visibility 0s 260ms"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-6 sm:px-8 pb-5"><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.6)">Add a card, then add funds to your Wallet — $10.00 minimum. After your first deposit you can turn on auto-reload so the balance refills itself. New accounts start with $8 in Wallet funds, so you can run Agent and Browser before you add a card.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="border-b last:border-b-0 transition-colors duration-150" style="border-color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.06)"><div class="relative"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 px-6 sm:px-8 py-5"><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><h3 class="m-0 transition-colors duration-150 text-base" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);font-weight:500;color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.9)">What happens when my Wallet reaches $0?</h3></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-lg leading-none transition-colors duration-150" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);font-weight:300;color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.5)">+</span></div><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-_R_77hbsnrlb_" class="absolute inset-0 w-full cursor-pointer"><span class="sr-only">What happens when my Wallet reaches $0?</span></button></div><div id="accordion-panel-_R_77hbsnrlb_" class="grid" style="grid-template-rows:0fr;visibility:hidden;transition:grid-template-rows 260ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1), visibility 0s 260ms"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-6 sm:px-8 pb-5"><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.6)">Nothing breaks. Search and Fetch keep running within their limits, since neither ever draws from the Wallet. An Agent run that is already under way will finish. Agent and Browser need funds to start, so make a deposit when you want to run them again.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="border-b last:border-b-0 transition-colors duration-150" style="border-color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.06)"><div class="relative"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 px-6 sm:px-8 py-5"><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><h3 class="m-0 transition-colors duration-150 text-base" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);font-weight:500;color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.9)">Is there a monthly plan?</h3></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-lg leading-none transition-colors duration-150" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);font-weight:300;color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.5)">+</span></div><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-_R_97hbsnrlb_" class="absolute inset-0 w-full cursor-pointer"><span class="sr-only">Is there a monthly plan?</span></button></div><div id="accordion-panel-_R_97hbsnrlb_" class="grid" style="grid-template-rows:0fr;visibility:hidden;transition:grid-template-rows 260ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1), visibility 0s 260ms"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-6 sm:px-8 pb-5"><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.6)">No. There are no recurring Wallet plans. You fund the Wallet and pay for the Agent and Browser usage you actually run.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="border-b last:border-b-0 transition-colors duration-150" style="border-color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.06)"><div class="relative"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 px-6 sm:px-8 py-5"><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><h3 class="m-0 transition-colors duration-150 text-base" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);font-weight:500;color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.9)">Are Search and Fetch really free?</h3></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-lg leading-none transition-colors duration-150" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);font-weight:300;color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.5)">+</span></div><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-_R_b7hbsnrlb_" class="absolute inset-0 w-full cursor-pointer"><span class="sr-only">Are Search and Fetch really free?</span></button></div><div id="accordion-panel-_R_b7hbsnrlb_" class="grid" style="grid-template-rows:0fr;visibility:hidden;transition:grid-template-rows 260ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1), visibility 0s 260ms"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-6 sm:px-8 pb-5"><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.6)">Yes, Search at 30 requests / min and 500 requests / hour, Fetch at 150 urls / min and 1,000 urls / day. No charge, no Wallet draw, and they keep working at a $0 balance.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="border-b last:border-b-0 transition-colors duration-150" style="border-color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.06)"><div class="relative"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 px-6 sm:px-8 py-5"><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><h3 class="m-0 transition-colors duration-150 text-base" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);font-weight:500;color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.9)">Can I raise concurrency or rate limits?</h3></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-lg leading-none transition-colors duration-150" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);font-weight:300;color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.5)">+</span></div><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-_R_d7hbsnrlb_" class="absolute inset-0 w-full cursor-pointer"><span class="sr-only">Can I raise concurrency or rate limits?</span></button></div><div id="accordion-panel-_R_d7hbsnrlb_" class="grid" style="grid-template-rows:0fr;visibility:hidden;transition:grid-template-rows 260ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1), visibility 0s 260ms"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-6 sm:px-8 pb-5"><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.6)">Yes. Accounts start at 2 concurrent runs on Agent and 5 concurrent sessions on Browser, and both go up. Talk to sales and we will set them to your workload. Limits live on your account rather than being bought with Wallet funds, so raising them is a conversation, not a purchase.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="border-b last:border-b-0 transition-colors duration-150" style="border-color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.06)"><div class="relative"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 px-6 sm:px-8 py-5"><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><h3 class="m-0 transition-colors duration-150 text-base" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);font-weight:500;color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.9)">I&#x27;m on a legacy credit plan. Where do I see my pricing?</h3></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-lg leading-none transition-colors duration-150" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);font-weight:300;color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.5)">+</span></div><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-_R_f7hbsnrlb_" class="absolute inset-0 w-full cursor-pointer"><span class="sr-only">I&#x27;m on a legacy credit plan. Where do I see my pricing?</span></button></div><div id="accordion-panel-_R_f7hbsnrlb_" class="grid" style="grid-template-rows:0fr;visibility:hidden;transition:grid-template-rows 260ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1), visibility 0s 260ms"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-6 sm:px-8 pb-5"><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.6)">Your credit rates and balance live in your account dashboard. Sign in and they are all there.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden" style="background-color:#0a0a0a" data-dark-header="black"><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" style="opacity:0.42"><picture class="block h-full w-full"><source media="(min-width: 1920px)" srcSet="/dither/pricing-close-2560x446@1x.png 1x, /dither/pricing-close-2560x446@2x.png 2x"/><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="/dither/pricing-close-1919x446@1x.png 1x, /dither/pricing-close-1919x446@2x.png 2x"/><source media="(min-width: 640px)" srcSet="/dither/pricing-close-1023x434@1x.png 1x, /dither/pricing-close-1023x434@2x.png 2x"/><img src="/dither/pricing-close-430x391@2x.png" srcSet="/dither/pricing-close-430x391@1x.png 1x, /dither/pricing-close-430x391@2x.png 2x" alt="" aria-hidden="true" decoding="async" loading="lazy" fetchPriority="auto" draggable="false" class="block h-full w-full object-cover select-none " style="image-rendering:pixelated;background-color:#0a0a0a"/></picture></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" style="background:radial-gradient(120% 120% at 50% 42%, transparent 0%, transparent 26%, rgba(10,10,10,0.72) 66%, #0a0a0a 100%)"></div><div class="relative z-[1] max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 py-24 sm:py-28 flex flex-col items-center text-center"><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0s, transform 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0s"><h2 class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-[72px] leading-[0.96]" style="font-family:var(--font-familjen);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.047em;color:rgb(255 255 255 / 0.94)">Start building</h2></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.08s, transform 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.08s"><p class="text-[16px] leading-[1.6] max-w-[400px] mt-6" style="font-family:var(--font-inter);color:rgb(255 255 255 / 0.55)">Search and Fetch are free. Fund the Wallet when you need Agent or Browser.</p></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.16s, transform 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.16s"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-6 mt-8 flex-wrap"><style>
      @property --gb-_R_fohbsnrlb_-angle {
        syntax: '<angle>';
        initial-value: 0deg;
        inherits: false;
      }
      @keyframes gb-_R_fohbsnrlb_-spin {
        to { --gb-_R_fohbsnrlb_-angle: 360deg; }
      }
      .gb-_R_fohbsnrlb_-wrap {
        position: relative;
        display: inline-flex;
        background: conic-gradient(
          from var(--gb-_R_fohbsnrlb_-angle),
          transparent 30%,
          #FF6700 50%,
          transparent 70%
        );
        padding: 1px;
        animation: gb-_R_fohbsnrlb_-spin 3s linear infinite;
        transition: background 0.3s ease;
      }
      .gb-_R_fohbsnrlb_-wrap > * {
        flex: 1 1 auto;
        width: 100%;
      }
      .gb-_R_fohbsnrlb_-wrap:hover {
        background: #FF6700;
        animation: none;
      }
      .gb-_R_fohbsnrlb_-wrap::after {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        /* Square halo behind a rounded wrap bleeds at the corners. */
        border-radius: inherit;
        background: conic-gradient(
          from var(--gb-_R_fohbsnrlb_-angle),
          transparent 30%,
          rgba(255,103,0,0.35) 50%,
          transparent 70%
        );
        filter: blur(6px);
        animation: gb-_R_fohbsnrlb_-spin 3s linear infinite;
        z-index: -1;
        transition: background 0.3s ease, filter 0.3s ease;
      }
      .gb-_R_fohbsnrlb_-wrap:hover::after {
        background: rgba(255,103,0,0.4);
